##
##    PrePoMax --> code_aster from "pmx2aster.py" V0.1.4 | [ 01-Oct-2025 ] 
##    Made by Sound Spinning | soundspinning@hotmail.com
##    Meant to be run from a terminal with `run_aster *.export` instead of with `as_run`
##

 #  "forced_X_R3_assy_8bolts.inp" model HEADING:
 # Hash: 3QCKejya, Date: 10/29/2025, Unit system: MM_TON_S_C
 # forced_X_R3_assy_8bolts.pmx
 # FORCED Response:
 # shock wave - modal dynamics
 # RESTART off modal run from global model
 # 
 # GLOBAL:
 # Bolt pretension + tied contacts
 # Cold Assy (bolt load), Unit loads & 
 # modal check (with and without constraints).
 # [ See hand edits in deck ]
 # - statics: Tied contacts only in normal direction (DX) in step#1.
 #            Lock bolts in Step#2; i.e. switch to `tied2` pairs on all DoF.
 # - modal: `Tied_mod` contacts in all 3 DoF, avoid RBModes.
 # --------------------------------

### RAM in MB - Since V16.7 the solver grabs 90% of this input
P memory_limit 64000
P ncpus 1
### max solve time in seconds ==> 4e5s = 4.63days 
P time_limit 400000.0

## Input deck
F comm forced_X_R3_assy_8bolts.comm D  1

## Input mesh - ASTER format
F mesh forced_X_R3_assy_8bolts.msh D  21

## Output message file
F mesg forced_X_R3_assy_8bolts.msg R  6

## Output text results file
F data forced_X_R3_assy_8bolts.dat R  8

## MED results file#1
F rmed forced_X_R3_assy_8bolts.rmed R  80
## MED results file#2
F rmed forced_X_R3_assy_8bolts_points_springs.rmed R  81

## Output FOLDER for global restart files, also useful for Sub-modelling
## When reading the `base` in a restart run, change RC --> DC
## R base forced_X_R3_assy_8bolts RC 0

## Output local temp FOLDER (if needed) for solver temp (.med) files
## R repe TMP R  0

## RESTART reads global results folder
R base global_R3_assy_8bolts DC 0
